# The Dead Letter Office's held-mail vault (CIPlay dead_letter_office_caves, 11-12 w12 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe: the vault's mouth at -10 -36 (way in +z, one tunnel of 7.3 m), the den ~22 m long behind it,
# its hatch at -10 -18.2 and chest at -9.4 -17 (locked until Clerk Rouhi's talk, shown by her answer 2). Floor ~3.5 m
# (a guess). Rouhi at 55 -24.5. Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build.
island The Dead Letter Office keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
empty
expect hidden dlvaulthatch
expect hidden dlvaultchest

# Rouhi first: the second answer shows the hatch
use Clerk Rouhi pick 2
expect message follow the HELD MAIL sign
expect shown dlvaulthatch

# In by the mouth, to the den
picture dl_vault_out -10 +3 -50 -10 +1.5 -36
walk -10 -44 to -10 -36 to -10 -30 to -10 -24 to -10 -20
picture dl_vault_in -10 +3 -23 -10 +0.5 -18 light=20

# The hatch opens on the held mail
use dlvaulthatch stay
expect message held mail
expect hidden dlvaulthatch
expect shown dlvaultchest
open Held mail
wait 2
expect item Placeable_PaperBundle 3

# And out again
walk -10 -20 to -10 -26 to -10 -33 to -10 -38 to -10 -46
